 707+ 86A7              ; Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore
 708+ 86A7              ; Se player_score > high_score, copia player_score in high_score.
 709+ 86A7              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------
 710+ 86A7              Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore:
 711+ 86A7                  ; Confronto BCD a 3 byte (big-endian: byte 2 -> byte 1 -> byte 0)
 712+ 86A7                  ; Byte 2:
