 166+ 8728 ~            Audio_MusicSheet:
 167+ 8728 ~                ; Formato: db delay, durata (in frame a 50Hz)
 168+ 8728 ~                db 96, 5, 101, 15, 96, 5, 107, 25, 152, 5, 143, 35, 107, 15, 96, 10
 169+ 8728 ~                db 107, 10, 96, 10, 107, 25, 96, 10, 85, 10, 81, 10, 85, 5, 81, 10
 170+ 8728 ~                db 85, 10, 96, 70, 72, 40, 81, 10, 76, 5, 85, 20, 96, 10, 107, 25
